# {{lb|en|cooking|transitive}} To [[sear]] after [[blach]]ing.
# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To have a blister form.
#* {{quote-book|en|title=Walls and Ceilings|editor=Robert M. Jones| ISBN=0809434520| year=1980| publisher=Time-Life Books| page=26| passage=A poorly formulated mortar mixture will result in plaster that '''blisters''' and cracks.}}
